    "description": "The Airline Flights Seatmap API provides users with detailed seatmap information for various airline flights. This endpoint allows consumers, such as travel agencies and airline booking systems, to access visual layouts of available seating options, enhancing the booking experience. By querying this API, users can review seating arrangements, view available seats, and make informed decisions when selecting their preferred travel accommodations. It is invaluable for improving user satisfaction and streamlining the flight selection process.",
